{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1521724-core-book-clarification","id":1521724,"title":"Core Book Clarification","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-30T21:27:17-07:00","id":1521724,"title":"Core Book Clarification","content":"So reading the corebook and am trying to sus out how this game works, (from what I'm reading it's sounds grand) but there are definite short falls, it seems some pages got lost in the Story Guiding chapter and certain assumptions were made.<br /> <br /> Like what is a Story Milestone, it's not defined, and I never used the term before. This is coming from some one who ran a plethora of other games that are super crunchy but please don't throw terms out for core mechanics and leave me hanging.<br /> <br /> More later","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1435-videopete","name":"videopete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1435_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-30T22:01:17-07:00","id":1521730,"title":"","content":"It's very confusing, but I think that in the case of character advancement's &quot;story milestone,&quot; the word &quot;milestone&quot; is not being used in its game mechanical jargon sense but in a natural language sense. It just means what the word &quot;milestone&quot; means: a turning point or significant moment in development.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-31T02:53:45-07:00","id":1521734,"title":"","content":"I agree with Stupid Loserman, the book is largely descriptive, not caring much about defining some aspects.<br /> <br /> The system is great, the rules are pretty solid, most of the &quot;sub-systems&quot; works amazingly well and the less rigorous definitions of Skills and Attributes when rolling are amazing to define how the characters are actually doing whatever they are doing. Yet there are many moments when the definitions are needed and we are left in a void to decide for ourselfes.<br /> <br /> Examples are many once you start running the game, where you must limit the advantages the character have to a certain aspect of the roll, but you dont have rules to support it, the best example is the enhancements you gain from power scale that can be used to hit the target instead of only causing damage, or how to deal with super science Enhancement x Edge dots and flaws.<br /> <br /> It was a brand new system, so its not hard to leave lose ends and loopholes, but they are far from breaking the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}